  "description": "OpenCanary honeypot alerts via Alloy \u2192 Loki ({namespace=\"opencanary\",container=\"opencanary\"}). Alerts are single-line JSON (fields: logtype, src_host, dst_host, src_port, dst_port, logdata, utc_time). logtype >= 2000 keeps attacker events (3000-3003 HTTP, 4000-4002 SSH) and drops 1000-series daemon noise.",
